        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "House Flipper is a unique chance to become the one-man renovating crew. You've got to earn it around here before you purchase your first property. No worries though! Luckily, there's plenty of work at your fingertips! Take job offers from nearby residents to clean up, paint walls, install heaters, showers, and air conditioners, or even furnish their whole property! Once the grateful clients pay you for your solid work, it's time to get your own house.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "House Flipper es una oportunidad única de convertirte en un equipo de reforma de una sola persona. Tendrás que ganártelo antes de comprar tu primera propiedad. ¡Pero no te preocupes! Afortunadamente, hay mucho trabajo a tu alcance. Acepta encargos de los vecinos de la zona para limpiar, pintar paredes, instalar calefactores, duchas y aires acondicionados, o incluso amueblar toda su propiedad. Cuando los agradecidos clientes te paguen por tu buen trabajo, ¡será hora de conseguir tu propia casa!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2018",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
